      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While the rule-based nature of the ADF system does improve transparency and audibility, I worry that it might oversimplify the complexities of liquidity management during stress scenarios. The simulations might be assuming a static, non-evolving market environment, whereas real-world stress conditions can exhibit highly nonlinear and dynamic behavior. For instance, the ADF system's responses may be less effective in events where systemic risk transmission and interconnectedness play a significant role.",
